   * 2. description: Required, string, 1-512 characters
   * 3. configuration_type: Required, must be one of: string, integer, boolean, json
   * 4. scope: Required, must be one of: global, staging, production
   * 5. default_value: Optional, string (can be null)
   * 6. is_active: Required, boolean
   *
   * Database operation:
   * - Insert new record with auto-generated UUID for id field
   * - Set created_at and updated_at to current timestamp
   * - Set deleted_at to NULL (active record)
