   * 3. Extract updatable fields from request body: description, configuration_type, scope, default_value, is_active
   * 4. Reject attempts to modify configuration_key as it is immutable after creation
   * 5. Verify configuration_type is one of the allowed types (string, integer, boolean, json)
   * 6. Verify scope is one of the allowed values (global, staging, production)
   * 7. Update all mutable fields in the database record
